### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "ana@example.com", "fullName": "Ana García", "password": "correct-horse-battery"}

### Log in and keep the token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "ana@example.com", "password": "correct-horse-battery"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Open a EUR wallet
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currency": "EUR"}

> {% client.global.set("wallet", response.body.id); %}

### Deposit (send it twice: the second response has Idempotent-Replayed: true)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wallets/{{wallet}}/deposits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: deposit-2026-10-26-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 250.00}

### Withdraw
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wallets/{{wallet}}/withdrawals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: withdrawal-2026-10-26-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 40.50}

### Transfer to another wallet (same currency)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: transfer-2026-10-26-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"sourceWalletId": "{{wallet}}", "targetWalletId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "amount": 10, "description": "Dinner"}

### Open a USD wallet, to convert into
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currency": "USD"}

> {% client.global.set("walletUsd", response.body.id); %}

### Convert EUR to USD at the latest rate (needs fx-rate-service at FX_RATE_URL)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conversions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: conversion-2026-10-26-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"sourceWalletId": "{{wallet}}", "targetWalletId": "{{walletUsd}}", "amount": 10}

> {% client.global.set("conversion", response.body.id); %}

### The conversion again, with the rate it was made at
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transactions/{{conversion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My wallets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ledger, newest first
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wallets/{{wallet}}/transactions?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
